OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 81, killed nephew due to
OL,4,Amental disorder - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 81-year-old man stabbed his nephew
OL,7,F11 times because of his "psychotic,
OL,8,Fdelusional disorder", a murder trial
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FFirefighters found Andrew Avery, 65,
OL,12,Flying in a smoke-filled house in
OL,13,FGosport, Hampshire, in November 2024.
OL,15,FDefendant Alan Wotton believed his
OL,16,Fnephew was a "malicious adversary" who
OL,17,Fwas about to attack him, might be
OL,18,Fdefrauding him and had spread false
OL,19,Frumours about him being a paedophile,
OL,20,FPortsmouth Crown Court was told.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
