OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 81, killed nephew due to
OL,4,Amental disorder - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FWotton, who is now aged 83, is accused
OL,7,Fof murder, which he denies, and faces
OL,8,Fan alternative charge of manslaughter.
